antities; exchange lot/tick rounding and capacity are not modeled.","Known opening stop/target events resolve before later intrabar extremes. Otherwise stop-first for ambiguous OHLC; gap-through stops use the worse open, while favorable target gaps fill at the fixed target. No target fill on an entry bar. Stops remain active. Maximum hold 72 hours; predeclared fold boundaries flatten at the final bar open with both exit costs.","Drawdown uses hourly equity including estimated liquidation costs, not an intrabar worst-case path. No fees for idle cash, funding, shorting, leverage, tax or liquidity impact beyond fixed slippage.","Degradation and low-sample flags are descriptive; these short, single-symbol folds do not prove robustness, eliminate overfitting, or estimate a probability of future profit.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 1: training 2026-09-28T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-15T08:59:59.999Z, 23 trades, -10.517%; test 2026-10-15T09:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-20T21:59:59.999Z, 5 trades, -3.206% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 2: training 2026-09-28T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-20T21:59:59.999Z, 28 trades, -13.386%; test 2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-26T10:59:59.999Z, 2 trades, 0.471% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum, fold 3: training 2026-09-28T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-26T10:59:59.999Z, 29 trades, -12.680%; test 2026-10-26T11:00:00.000Z to 2026-11-01T00:59:59.999Z, 3 trades, -3.050% net.","EMA 21/50 + RSI momentum: low sample (10 out-of-sample trades; warning threshold 30).","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 1: training 2026-09-28T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-15T08:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000%; test 2026-10-15T09:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-20T21:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% net.","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 2: training 2026-09-28T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-20T21:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000%; test 2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-26T10:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.000% net.","EMA 50 + RSI pullback, fold 3: training 2026-09-28T17:00:00.000Z to 2026-10-26T10:59:59.999Z, 0 trades, 0.